      "problem": "Expand the following product of binomials. Write your answer in **standard form.**\n\n$(11u-6)(7u+2)=$\n{{field-1}}",
      "worked_solution": "We take each term of the first binomial and multiply it by the second binomial. Then, we simplify by collecting like terms.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(11u-6)(7u+2) & = \\\\ 11u(7u+2)+(-6)(7u+2) & = \\\\ 77{u}^{2}+22u-42u-12 & = \\\\ 77{u}^{2}-20u-12\\end{aligned}\n$$",
